{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50259","headline":"冯双礼珠弹云璈以答歌 · 李翔","name":"冯双礼珠弹云璈以答歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王母词终荐碧桃，答歌仙子奏云璈。\n调凌空洞音初起，曲丽钧天韵更高。\n霞断已翔烟际鹤，风生欲拚海心鳌。\n瑶池侍女争回首，无隈琅英坠节毛。\n（项云「无隈」当作「无限」，形近而误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}